st-none flex justify-between items-center">Compare <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#b7ffa2"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-[#33452d]"><a href="/compare/terminals/" class="tt-green block px-6 py-4 hover:bg-[#33452d] text-base">Compare Terminals</a> <a href="/compare/ai-coding-agents/" class="tt-green block px-6 py-4 hover:bg-[#33452d] text-base">Compare AI Coding Agents</a></div></details> <details class="w-full border border-[#33452d]"><summary class="tt-green px-4 py-4 cursor-pointer text-base list-none flex justify-between items-center">More <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#b7ffa2"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-[#33452d]"><a href="/terminals/" class="tt-green block px-6 py-4 hover:bg-[#33452d] text-base">Terminals</a> <a href="/ai-coding-agents/" class="tt-green block px-6 py-4 hover:bg-[#33452d] text-base">AI Coding Agents</a> <a href="/about/" class="tt-green block px-6 py-4 hover:bg-[#33452d] text-base">About</a> <a href="/tool-of-the-week/" class="tt-green block px-6 py-4 hover:bg-[#33452d] text-base">Tool of The Week</a></div></details></div><div class="shrink-0 px-1 py-3 border-t border-[#33452d]"><a title="Submit a Tool" href="/submit/" class="btn btn-primary normal-case w-full">Submit a Tool</a></div></div></div></div></nav></div><div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-2 bg-black shadow-lg"><main class="text-white"><div class="container mx-auto max-w-2xl px-2 py-8 bg-black shadow-lg"><div class="hero-content justify-start"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="flex flex-row"><h1 class="font-sg text-4xl">List of Terminal Tools (A-Z)</h1></div><p class="mt-5">Below is a list of terminal tools in alphabetical order (A-Z) and updated regularly.</p><p class="mt-5 mb-2">Looking for <a class="tt-link" href="/categories/">categories?</a></p><div class="flex mt-5 items-baseline"><a class="flex flex-row tt-promo h-" href="https://coderabbit.link/terminal-trove-montly-002" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" data-sponsor-ad data-sponsor="CodeRabbit" data-sponsor-slot="list"><svg class="h-6 mr-2" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11 4.20603H6.79158L5.5 0L4.20842 4.20603H0L3.44231 6.79397L2.10169 11L5.5 8.39339L8.89831 11L7.55517 6.79397L11 4.20603Z" fill="#ffd043"></path></svg><div><span>CodeRabbit</span> <span class="text-white">-</span> <small class="text-white">Cut Code Review Time &amp; Bugs in Half. Supports TypeScript, Python, Java, Rust, and more.</small> <span class="text-white">- </span> <small style="color: #ffd043;">Install CodeRabbit CLI <svg class="inline-block -mb-1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 4 23 22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></small></div></a></div>     </div></div><div class="hero-content mb-3 mt-6 justify-start"><h2 id="A" class="font-sg text-5xl">A</h2></div><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=abtop tt-link" href="/abtop/">abtop</a> - <small>Like btop, but for your AI coding agents.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=act tt-link" href="/act/">act</a> - <small>Run your GitHub Actions locally</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=act3 tt-link" href="/act3/">act3</a> - <small>Glance at the last 3 runs of your Github Actions.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=ad tt-link" href="/ad/">ad</a> - <small>An adaptable text editor.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=adguardian-term tt-link" href="/adguardian-term/">adguardian-term</a> - <small>An AdGuard Home terminal monitoring tool.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=adsb-tui tt-link" href="/adsb-tui/">adsb-tui</a> - <small>A modern terminal user interface for tracking aircraft using ADS-B data.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=aerc tt-link" href="/aerc/">aerc</a> - <small>A pretty good email client.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=age tt-link" href="/age/">age</a> - <small>A simple, modern and secure file encryption tool.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=aic tt-link" href="/aic/">aic</a> - <small>Fetch the latest changelogs for popular AI coding assistants.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=aichat tt-link" href="/aichat/">aichat</a> - <small>all-in-one AI powered CLI chat and copilot.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=aider tt-link" href="/aider/">aider</a> - <small>AI pair programming in your terminal.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=aim tt-link" href="/aim/">aim</a> - <small>A command line download/upload tool with resume.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=ali tt-link" href="/ali/">ali</a> - <small>A load testing tool capable of performing real-time analysis.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=amdtop tt-link" href="/amdtop/">amdtop</a> - <small>A TUI system monitor specialized for AMD GPUs.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=amfora tt-link" href="/amfora/">amfora</a> - <small>A fancy terminal browser for the Gemini protocol.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=amp tt-link" href="/amp/">amp</a> - <small>A complete text editor for your terminal.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=amux tt-link" href="/amux/">amux</a> - <small>A TUI for easily running parallel coding agents.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=andcli tt-link" href="/andcli/">andcli</a> - <small>A 2FA TUI for your shell.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=angryoxide tt-link" href="/angryoxide/">angryoxide</a> - <small>A WiFi attack and pentesting tool built in Rust.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=apisnip tt-link" href="/apisnip/">apisnip</a> - <small>A TUI tool for trimming OpenAPI specifications down to size.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=aptui tt-link" href="/aptui/">aptui</a> - <small>A TUI package manager for APT-based Linux distributions.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=apw tt-link" href="/apw/">apw</a> - <small>A CLI for Apple Passwords (also known as iCloud Keychain)</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=arduino-cli-interactive tt-link" href="/arduino-cli-interactive/">arduino-cli-interactive</a> - <small>An Interactive way to use the arduino-cli.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=aria2 tt-link" href="/aria2/">aria2</a> - <small>The ultra fast download utility.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=aria2tui tt-link" href="/aria2tui/">aria2tui</a> - <small>A TUI client for the aria2 download utility.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=artui tt-link" href="/artui/">artui</a> - <small>Read and track recent arXiv papers with a TUI.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=asak tt-link" href="/asak/">asak</a> - <small>A cross-platform audio recording/playback CLI tool with a TUI.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=asciinema tt-link" href="/asciinema/">asciinema</a> - <small>A terminal session recorder.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=asmdiff tt-link" href="/asmdiff/">asmdiff</a> - <small>A tool to compare per-function C assembly across compilers and revisions.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=asn tt-link" href="/asn/">asn</a> - <small>ASN lookup tool and traceroute server</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=ast-grep tt-link" href="/ast-grep/">ast-grep</a> - <small>A CLI tool for code structural search, lint and rewriting.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=astroterm tt-link" href="/astroterm/">astroterm</a> - <small>A terminal-based star map.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=atac tt-link" href="/atac/">atac</a> - <small>A simple API client (postman like) in your terminal.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=atop tt-link" href="/atop/">atop</a> - <small>An advanced interactive monitor for linux systems.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=atuin tt-link" href="/atuin/">atuin</a> - <small>Sync, search and backup shell history.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=auggie tt-link" href="/auggie/">auggie</a> - <small>All the power of Augment Code in your terminal.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=austin-tui tt-link" href="/austin-tui/">austin-tui</a> - <small>The top-like text-based user interface for Austin.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-name=az_list_item_click plausible-event-tool=awsesh tt-link" href="/awsesh/">awsesh</a> - <small>A charming TUI for AWS SSO session management.</small><br></li></ol><ol class="pl-5"><li class="list-item"><a class="plausible-event-n